      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<div data-visibility=\"gm\">\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The bunyip is not @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued} or already in a frenzy.</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The bunyip deals bleed damage to a living creature.</p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The bunyip flies into a frenzy that lasts 1 minute. While frenzied, the bunyip gains a +4 status bonus to damage rolls with its jaws, gains 8 temporary HP that go away at the end of the frenzy, and takes a -2 penalty to AC.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.bestiary-effects.ScZ8tlV5zS0Jwnqn]{Effect: Blood Frenzy}</p>"
        },
        "source": {
          "value": ""
        },
