        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The bunyip lets out a loud and horrifying roar. Other creatures within @Template[type:emanation|distance:100]{100 feet} must succeed at a @Check[type:will|dc:21] save<span data-visibility=\"gm\"> or become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} (@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} on a critical failure,@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} on a success, or unaffected on a critical success)</span>.</p>\n<p data-visibility=\"gm\">No matter the result, the creature is temporarily immune to the effect for 1 minute.</p>"
